03578186],"scale":[1,0.9999999403953552,1.0000001192092896],"translation":[-9.484210750088096e-09,0.40733101963996887,-2.0954757928848267e-09]},{"children":[48],"name":"calf_r","rotation":[0.058844517916440964,-0.2321772277355194,0.008530084043741226,0.9708544611930847],"scale":[0.9999998807907104,0.9999997615814209,0.9999999403953552],"translation":[-5.587935447692871e-09,0.39470696449279785,7.450580596923828e-09]},{"children":[49],"name":"thigh_r","rotation":[-0.958074688911438,0.09174000471830368,-0.2139034867286682,0.16709880530834198],"scale":[0.9999998211860657,0.9999999403953552,0.9999985098838806],"translation":[-0.10147152096033096,-0.003829043358564377,-0.010990308597683907]},{"children":[42,46,50],"name":"pelvis","rotation":[0.5305899977684021,-1.5553862193127784e-16,-3.88809262563683e-10,0.8476285934448242],"translation":[0,-0.013216575607657433,0.8744488954544067]},{"children":[51],"name":"Root","rotation":[-0.7071067690849304,0,0,0.7071067690849304],"translation":[0,-0.0005625183694064617,6.100162863731384e-08]},{"mesh":0,"name":"Body","skin":0},{"mesh":1,"name":"Eyebrows","skin":0},{"mesh":2,"name":"Eyelashes","skin":0},{"mesh":3,"name":"Eyes","skin":0},{"mesh":4,"name":"Teeth","skin":0},{"mesh":5,"name":"Tongue","skin":0},{"children":[53,54,55,56,57,58,52,60,61,62,63],"name":"Fern Lin","extras":{"persona":{"residentId":"AH-R1232","personId":"ah-pd-145","name":"Fern Lin","age":42,"occupation":"Police communications dispatcher","home":"Coast Ridge","episode":"A call heard twice","biography":"stories/residents/09/04-a-call-heard-twice.md#ah-r1232","life":"“I still remember a colleague giving me exactly one fact before handing over a voice.” Thursday often includes a stop at the bank steps, where Fern takes a few minutes to read the public notices, especially the ones written in a hurry.","voice":"I took the second call and inherited the trust the first voice had built. I want the writer to hear both names.","appearance":"Fern is easy to recognize by a soft fringe that falls across one eyebrow and a deep crease beside the mouth when smiling. Usually dressed in a pale blue work shirt with a pocket notebook shaped by years of sitting on it, Fern rubs a thumb along the edge of the nearest pocket when listening.","personality":"Fern talks very little about private fear and recognizes it quickly in strangers. Offering a choice of seats is one of Fern's ways of saying that it is all right to leave.","agenda":"To credit both conversations equally.","family":"Stella Choi is Fern’s cousin. Fern offers the first invitation. Stella gets to change the plan. They learned that a promise to visit is easier to keep when changing a time does not count as letting down the whole family. Asked about *A house divided kindly*, Stella says, “I used to squeeze through the gap to see my best friend.”","connections":"Imani Ford (first call taker). Restoring both voices to the letter is their first shared task after the interrupted call.","familyIds":["AH-R1436"],"connectionIds":["AH-R1231"],"reactions":[{"situation":"The resident asks for a reply in somebody's own words","response":"Fern asks the caller how they want to receive a personal reply.","asWritten":"The resident asks for a reply in somebody's own words. Fern asks the caller how they want to receive a personal reply."},{"situation":"A diner goes silent in the middle of a noisy family celebration","response":"Fern asks one close relative to check in privately instead of stopping the party for a public inquiry.","asWritten":"A diner goes silent in the middle of a noisy family celebration. Fern asks one close relative to check in privately instead of stopping the party for a public inquiry."},{"situation":"When pressed to explain someone else's silence","response":"Fern says only what happened and lets the absent person keep their reasons.","asWritten":"When pressed to explain someone else's silence, Fern says only what happened and lets the absent person keep their reasons."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_bob02","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_shirt","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_shoes","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","age_old","muscle_max","height_tall","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_spacing_decr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_decr","face_mouth_width_incr","face_ear_size_decr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_gender_female__age_old","corr_gender_female__muscle_max"]},"weights":[0.6297,0.2083,0.196,0.401,0.0438,0.0868,0.4466,0.1088,0.351,0.0909,0.4245,0.441,0.4822,0.4112,0.0542,0.0555,0,0,0.13117,0.12342],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","age_old","muscle_max","height_tall","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_spacing_decr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_decr","face_mouth_width_incr","face_ear_size_decr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_gender_female__age_old","corr_gender_female__muscle_max"]},"weights":[0.6297,0.2083,0.196,0.401,0.0438,0.0868,0.4